Historical generals, field marshals and admirals for Finland that the base game leaves out, each with a portrait painted from a period photograph.

[h2]Companion mod: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3830946508]Event Pack: Finland[/url][/h2]
Historical events for Finland, from the same author.

[h1]Info:[/h1]
- Works alone and beside any other Commanders Pack.
- Adds characters, so it changes the game checksum: not Ironman compatible.
- Needs a new game.
